export anchor EmailClient:
    description:
        Brightwork Mail, a made-up email client, with three panes. On a phone
        it shows the message list first.

    folders:
        Inbox 12, Starred, Snoozed, Sent, Drafts 2, Archive, and labels
        Clients, Invoices and Team.

    messages:
        - Northpass, Demo on Tuesday, "Looking forward to seeing the reports view", 08:44, unread, Clients
        - Priya Nair, Hero options, "B is my pick, see Canvas", 08:02, unread
        - Billing, Invoice 2026-10 is ready, 07:15, Invoices, has an attachment
        - Aiko Tanaka, Survey readout slides, yesterday, starred
        - Lumen Bakery, Re pricing question, yesterday
        - Newsletter, The small team digest, Friday

    openMessage:
        The Northpass email is open. From Dana Whitfield at Northpass, to Mara
        Okafor, sent 08:44. It reads "Hi Mara, looking forward to Tuesday. Can
        you show the reports view and how guests work? Thanks, Dana." Buttons
        for Reply, Reply all, Forward, Snooze and Archive.
